  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your outsider bloodline makes the waters a place of sanctuary for you.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Aquatic Ancestry<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your swim speed increases by +20 feet. Your darkvision range is doubled when underwater, unless you have the deepsight racial trait, in which case your underwater darkvision range is increased by 60 feet. You may spend one use of your mythic power to double your swim speed for 1 round.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc22\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
